flowchart LR
  subgraph left [左欄網頁]
    Profile["我的個人小卡片"]
    Person["對方小卡片"]
    Context["對話情境與想要語氣"]
    Replies["五種回覆選項"]
    Share["複製、分享、傳到 Discord"]
    Summary["整理成 Agent 摘要"]
  end

  subgraph right [右欄 AI 助手]
    Panel["聊天面板"]
    Brain["AI 回覆大腦"]
  end

  subgraph store [資料存放]
    PageData["小卡片與設定檔"]
    DiscordInbox["Discord 收件匣"]
    Webhook["Discord 頻道"]
  end

  Profile --> Summary
  Person --> Summary
  Context --> Summary
  Summary -->|"每則問題附上左欄情境"| Panel
  Panel --> Brain
  Brain -->|"依照人物關係與語氣產生回覆"| Replies
  Replies --> Share
  Share -->|"使用者確認後送出"| Webhook
  Profile -->|"儲存個人設定"| PageData
  Person -->|"儲存對方資料"| PageData
  PageData -->|"重新打開頁面時讀取"| Profile
  DiscordInbox -->|"進階功能：帶入別人訊息"| Context
